# PROJECT: VERIX AI — AICTE SMART VALIDATION PLATFORM

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, AI/ML engineer, Firebase architect, cybersecurity engineer, and product designer.

Build a complete, functional, responsive, production-oriented web application named **VERIX AI — AICTE Smart Validation**, designed to support preliminary validation of technical institution applications and supporting documents for the All India Council for Technical Education (AICTE).

This is not merely a dashboard mockup, static landing page, or UI prototype. Build a coherent full-stack application with real navigation, persistent data, authentication, role-based access, document uploads, validation workflows, officer review, notifications, reports, and audit logging.

The system must remain a decision-support platform. AI-generated flags are preliminary findings, not proof of fraud or non-compliance. Statutory scrutiny, physical inspections, and final regulatory decisions remain with authorized AICTE officials.

